## Chay backend

Kiem tra connection string trong `HRTMS/appsettings.json` hoac tham khao `HRTMS/appsettings.example.json`.

```powershell
dotnet run --project HRTMS
```

Health check:

```text
http://localhost:5199/api/health
```

## Chay frontend

```powershell
cd "Racing Hub Portal (1)"
npm install
npm run dev
```

Frontend mac dinh chay tai:

```text
http://localhost:8080
```

## Kiem tra nhanh

Build backend:

```powershell
dotnet build HRTMS\HRTMS.csproj -c Release
```

Smoke test API sau khi backend dang chay:

```powershell
.\scripts\smoke-api.ps1
```

Build va test frontend:

```powershell
cd "Racing Hub Portal (1)"
npm run build
npm test
```

## Ghi chu cau hinh

- Backend su dung SQL Server thong qua `DefaultConnection`.
- Trong moi truong Development, ung dung co the tu dong apply EF Core migrations neu cau hinh `Database:ApplyMigrationsOnStartup` cho phep.
- Frontend co the ket noi backend thong qua bien moi truong `VITE_API_URL`.
- CORS backend dang ho tro cac origin local phu hop cho qua trinh phat trien.
